<title>USA: TENNIS-AMELIA ISLAND WOMEN'S FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AMELIA ISLAND WOMEN'S FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>AMELIA ISLAND, Florida 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result at the</p>
<p>$450,000 Bausch &amp; Lomb Championships women's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 11-Mary Pierce (France) 6-2</p>
<p>6-3</p>
